WEBVTT

00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:07.240
Drop Keating onto a passage.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.035
Choose a suggestion to quote the passage.

00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:15.334
Try a quick release in the margin.

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:20.753
Find Keating’s companion setting.

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:26.204
Calm keeps Keating in place.

00:00:26.204 --> 00:00:33.719
Choose Off to turn the companion off.

